Topic 1: Describe a time when you were ill

I would like to talk about a time when I was ill.

Last year, I had the flu. I had a high fever, a headache, and a sore throat. I also felt very tired and didn't want to do anything.

The illness lasted for about four days. During that time, I stayed at home and took some medicine. My mother also prepared healthy food and reminded me to get enough rest.

Because of this illness, I couldn't go to school or meet my friends. I also missed some lessons.

It was not a good experience, but it taught me that health is very important. Since then, I have tried to eat healthy food and exercise regularly.

Topic 2:Describe a famous person that you would like to meet

I would like to talk about a famous person I want to meet. His name is Ludwig van Beethoven. He was a famous German composer and pianist.

He is famous for creating many beautiful and powerful pieces of music. One interesting thing about him is that he continued composing music even after he became deaf.

I want to meet him because I really admire his talent and determination. I think he was a strong person who never gave up, even when he faced many difficulties.

If I had a chance to meet him, I would ask him how he continued making music without hearing it. I would also like to take a photo with him and learn more about his life.

He is truly an inspiring person to me.

Topic 47: Describe a success that you were proud of

I would like to talk about a success that made me very proud. It was completing a difficult project at university.

At first, I didn't know how to start because the project had many difficult tasks. To achieve this success, I spent a lot of time researching, learning new things, and working with my teammates.

During the project, we had some problems with our code and sometimes we didn't know how to fix them. However, we discussed the problems and tried different solutions together.

Finally, we completed the project successfully and received good feedback from our teacher.

I was very proud of myself because I learned many useful skills and became more confident. This experience taught me that hard work and patience can help me achieve my goals.

Topic 48: Describe a bad service you had at a shop or a restaurant

I would like to talk about a bad experience I had at a restaurant.

A few months ago, I went to a restaurant with my friends. We ordered some food and waited for about 40 minutes. However, the staff served us the wrong dishes.

When we asked them about the problem, they didn't apologize and seemed unfriendly. I felt disappointed and uncomfortable because we had to wait for a long time.

After that, I complained to the manager. Luckily, the manager listened to us and changed the dishes. He also apologized for the inconvenience.

Although the problem was solved, I didn't have a good experience at that restaurant. I think good customer service is very important for every business.

Topic 49: Describe an outdoor sport you would like to try

I would like to talk about an outdoor sport I want to try. It is hiking.

I first knew about this sport through videos on social media. I saw many people climbing mountains and enjoying beautiful natural views.

I think hiking can be quite difficult because people have to walk long distances and climb steep paths. It also requires good physical health and preparation.

I would like to try hiking because I want to challenge myself and spend more time in nature. It is also a good way to improve my health and reduce stress.

In the future, I hope I can go hiking with my friends. I think it will be an interesting and unforgettable experience.

Topic 50: Describe an interesting video that you watched on social media

I would like to talk about an interesting video I watched on social media.

I watched it about two weeks ago on TikTok. The video was about Ludwig van Beethoven, a famous German composer.

In the video, I learned about his life and his music. The most surprising thing was that he became deaf but continued composing beautiful music. He didn't give up even though he faced many difficulties.

I found this video very interesting because it taught me something new about music and history. I was also impressed by his determination and passion.

After watching the video, I wanted to learn more about his life and listen to some of his famous music. I think this video was both educational and inspiring.